iga-nurbs-weights.out
Patch test of nurbsplanestresselement with non-unit weights: affine control point displacements give constant strain
LinearStatic nsteps 1 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 2dPlaneStress
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 9 nelem 1 ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 9 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 10
node 1 coords 2 0.0 0.0
