#
# Biquadratic NURBS patch (one knot span, 3 x 3 control points, weights 0.6 to 1.3) of a distorted square.
# All control points get u = A X + b with A = [0.01 0.002; 0.004 -0.003], b = (0.1, -0.2). The rational
# basis functions are a partition of unity, so the displacement field is affine for any positive weights
# and the strain is constant: e_xx = 0.01, e_yy = -0.003, gamma_xy = 0.006 at every Gauss point.
# Plane stress, E = 1, nu = 0.25: s_xx = (e_xx + nu e_yy)/(1 - nu^2), s_yy = (e_yy + nu e_xx)/(1 - nu^2),
# s_xy = gamma_xy/(2 (1 + nu)).
#
#%BEGIN_CHECK% tolerance 1.e-12
## strains at all Gauss points
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 4 component 1 value 0.01
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 4 component 2 value -0.003
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 4 component 6 value 0.006
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 2 keyword 4 component 1 value 0.01
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 2 keyword 4 component 2 value -0.003
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 2 keyword 4 component 6 value 0.006
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 3 keyword 4 component 1 value 0.01
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 3 keyword 4 component 2 value -0.003
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 3 keyword 4 component 6 value 0.006
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 4 keyword 4 component 1 value 0.01
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 4 keyword 4 component 2 value -0.003
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 4 keyword 4 component 6 value 0.006
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 5 keyword 4 component 1 value 0.01
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 5 keyword 4 component 2 value -0.003
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 5 keyword 4 component 6 value 0.006
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 6 keyword 4 component 1 value 0.01
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 6 keyword 4 component 2 value -0.003
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 6 keyword 4 component 6 value 0.006
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 7 keyword 4 component 1 value 0.01
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 7 keyword 4 component 2 value -0.003
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 7 keyword 4 component 6 value 0.006
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 8 keyword 4 component 1 value 0.01
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 8 keyword 4 component 2 value -0.003
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 8 keyword 4 component 6 value 0.006
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 9 keyword 4 component 1 value 0.01
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 9 keyword 4 component 2 value -0.003
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 9 keyword 4 component 6 value 0.006
## stresses at the first and the last Gauss point
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 1 component 1 value 0.0098666666666666659
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 1 component 2 value -0.00053333333333333336
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 1 component 6 value 0.0024000000000000002
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 9 keyword 1 component 1 value 0.0098666666666666659
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 9 keyword 1 component 2 value -0.00053333333333333336
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 9 keyword 1 component 6 value 0.0024000000000000002
#%END_CHECK%
